# OpenRouter API key — get one at https://openrouter.ai/keys
# NEVER commit a real key to version control.
#
# This is a SERVER-SIDE-ONLY variable (no VITE_ prefix), read by the
# api/chat.js serverless function via process.env.OPENROUTER_API_KEY. It is
# never bundled into client-side JavaScript and never reaches the browser.
#
# Local dev: `vite dev` alone does not run the serverless function — use
# `vercel dev` instead so api/chat.js is served. Production/preview: set
# this as an Environment Variable in the Vercel project dashboard (not a
# build-time VITE_ variable).
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
